# Keep source + tooling out of the Cloudflare Workers static bundle.
# Only the built `build/` artifact is served for the portal prototype.
**/node_modules/**
microsites/city/goGov/cos-portal-prototype/src/**
microsites/city/goGov/cos-portal-prototype/scripts/**
microsites/city/goGov/cos-portal-prototype/public/**
microsites/city/goGov/cos-portal-prototype/*.json
microsites/city/goGov/cos-portal-prototype/*.ts
microsites/city/goGov/cos-portal-prototype/*.js
microsites/city/goGov/cos-portal-prototype/*.md
microsites/city/goGov/cos-portal-prototype/.gitignore
microsites/city/goGov/cos-portal-prototype/index.html
microsites/city/goGov/cos-portal-prototype/eslint.config.*

# Editor / agent state and OS cruft — never serve. Note: Eleventy's
# addPassthroughCopy("shared"/"microsites") copies whole trees verbatim and
# ignores .eleventyignore, so this file (with prune-build) is the real gate.
**/.claude/**
**/.DS_Store

# Internal data tooling (BLS wage scripts + agent worktree snapshots), not pages.
shared/optimizingScripts/**
